.claude/
*.download
# the shared baseline model and its submission (Run F) are committed on purpose
!final_model/final_model.pt
!final_model/submission.csv
# per-submission folders share their weights and CSVs on purpose (each model.pt is about 18.6 MB)
!submissions/**/model.pt
!submissions/**/*.csv
